  unitName: Taurus of Fate (EU)
  unitId: 730186
  unitNumber: 7142
  description: Arbez leads an exemplary life, the champion of his world, fighting
    alongside the oppressed. One day, as he passed through a quiet village, celebrating
    the return of Taurus to the skies, he felt the presence of somebody he thought
    had disappeared a long time ago, but before he had time to shout out, his mind
    was filled with pictures and details about the end of the world. He knew he had
    to act, the Corruption was tainting one world after another, and Llewxam, still
    alive, was looking for champions who were able to stop it. He left in quest of
    those who would be compatible with the powers of the constellation portal Llewxam
    used.
  summonDesc: This world needs us. Help me save them, summoner!
  fusionDesc: This power lets me protect those who are worthy of it.
